## Distribution Limitation

You may distribute copies of the software only as part of a
larger work, or if you make no changes to the software, and
only if you provide a copy of this license with the software
and do not remove any copyright, trademark, or attribution
notices.

## Changes and New Works Limitation

You may make changes or new works based on the software only
for permitted purposes. If you distribute any changes or new
works based on the software, you must license them under
these terms, provide a copy of this license with them, and
not remove any copyright, trademark, or attribution notices.

## Permitted Purpose

A permitted purpose is any purpose other than a commercial
purpose.

## Commercial Purpose

A commercial purpose is any purpose where you or someone
else uses the software or a new work based on the software
to make money, generate revenue, or obtain a commercial
advantage.

## Patent License

The licensor grants you a patent license for the software that
